    {
      id: "about",
      label: "About",
      icon: "info",
      type: "content",
      markdown: [
        {
          title: "Overview",
          content: [
            "> [!WARNING]",
            "> Confoederatio Dataview is currently a **work-in-progress**.",
            "This means that you may see placeholder text, misalignment issues, and features that may not display as intended.",
            "",
            "We advise you to not share this URL currently if you have access to it, or to advertise it publicly. Not that we would break your kneecaps, but the website might not always be online in such cases.",
            "",
            "Part of [Confoederatio](https://confoederatio.org/)."
          ],
        },
        {
          title: "Data Caveats",
          open: false,
          content: [
            "Complex multi-raster calculations are downsampled to `1080x540` for performance reasons.",
            "",
            "There are some known issues with NWM2.0 data we are currently working on.",
            "- Urban rasters and GHS-POP (which provides backcalculation for certain low-pop areas from 1800AD-1975AD) are offset 2px too far south.",
            "- Areas with a pop. density <0,5ihb/5-arcmin^2 are not currently shown.",
            "- Certain issues with multinomial logit distributions:",
            "  - Population pyramids are currently overly stochastic between adjacent age/sex bands.",
            "  - Professions are overly equalised between spatiotemporal domains.",
            "  - These issues have to do with the effect of how multinomial logit is presently implemented, as well as correction/constraint stages after training.",
            "- Not in work should be calculated as workforce-aged cohorts minus LFPR, but is currently flawed/corrupted.",
            "- Other known data caveats are shown in their respective mapmode descriptions.",
            "",
            "If you encounter any issues not documented here, please contact us at [Confoederatio Element](https://element.confoederatio.org)."
          ]
        }
      ],
    },
    {
      id: "policy",
      label: "Policy",
      icon: "gavel",
      type: "content",
      markdown: [
        {
          title: "Otherwise, we have no policy!",
          content: [
            "We're not big corpo."
          ],
        }
      ],
    },
